diff -ruN ui5work/ui5/CODEX_APPLY_AND_VERIFY.txt ui5fixed/CODEX_APPLY_AND_VERIFY.txt
--- ui5work/ui5/CODEX_APPLY_AND_VERIFY.txt	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
+++ ui5fixed/CODEX_APPLY_AND_VERIFY.txt	2026-03-18 02:08:21.423945461 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+Codex apply instructions
+========================
+
+1. Replace only the files included in this patch pack.
+2. Prefer applying `ui5_final_fix_pack.patch` first; if patch application fails, replace files manually from the changed-files archive.
+3. After applying, run these checks locally:
+   - `npm install`
+   - `npm run build`
+   - `npm run build:dist`
+   - `npm run validate`
+4. Verify that these conditions are true:
+   - bootstrap/theme uses `sap_fiori_3`, not `sap_horizon`
+   - `sap.ui.export` is declared in `manifest.json`
+   - both analytics export and search export route through Spreadsheet export, not XML `.xls` generation
+   - `package.json`, `ui5.yaml`, `.editorconfig`, `.stylelintrc.json`, `README_BUILD_AND_VALIDATE.md` exist
+5. Grep checks:
+   - `grep -R "sap_horizon" -n app` should return no productive runtime references
+   - `grep -R "ExcelExport.download" -n app` should return none or only compatibility wrapper use
+   - `grep -R "new ODataModel" -n app` should not show new productive-path additions
+6. Do not change the test bootstrap core URL.
+7. If any verification fails, inspect the touched files only; do not broad-rewrite unrelated modules.
diff -ruN ui5work/ui5/README_BUILD_AND_VALIDATE.md ui5fixed/README_BUILD_AND_VALIDATE.md
--- ui5work/ui5/README_BUILD_AND_VALIDATE.md	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
+++ ui5fixed/README_BUILD_AND_VALIDATE.md	2026-03-18 02:08:21.423870847 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+# Build and Validate
+
+## Productive baseline
+- Productive SAPUI5 target: **1.71.28**
+- Local/test bootstrap URL may still point to **1.71.70** because the test harness URL is intentionally not changed in this repository.
+- Treat **1.71.28** as the minimum supported productive baseline and regression-test critical flows on the real SAP landscape.
+
+## Local commands
+```bash
+npm install
+npm run build
+npm run build:dist
+npm run validate
+```
+
+## Expected output
+- `npm run build` and `npm run build:dist` create the `dist/` folder
+- Component preload is generated through UI5 Tooling
+- `npm run validate` runs CSS linting and XML view checks
+
+## Productive verification
+After building, verify on the real SAP stack:
+1. app startup
+2. search
+3. detail open/edit/save
+4. attachment flow
+5. analytics load and export
+6. lock acquire / heartbeat / release
+7. session timeout / CSRF refresh
+8. routing/FCL flows
